keywords:
  - community energy
  - cooperative game theory
  - Shapley value
  - shared battery storage
  - linear programming
  - ComErgy Grand Challenge 2026
abstract: "MATLAB model that operates the nine households of the ComErgy Benchmark Dataset 2026 as one cooperative pool: rooftop solar serves all loads first, the fourteen battery modules act as one shared store scheduled by a daily linear programme, the grid is used last under an import cap, and the annual saving is divided by the exact Shapley value over all 511 coalitions with a solidarity share for lower-income households. Entry to the ComErgy Community Energy Grand Challenge 2026."
